<title>UK: FEK sets 10 bln yen dual-currency August 1998 bond.</title>
<headline>FEK sets 10 bln yen dual-currency August 1998 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Wako International (Europe) Limited.</p>
<p> BORROWER   FINNISH EXPORT CREDIT</p>
<p> AMT   *10 BLN YEN    COUPON     4.0	 MATURITY    12.AUG.98</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.0     PAY DATE    12.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.60	LISTING    NONE	PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   DENOMS (K) 100-1M    SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.10	SELL CONC  1.50	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	*FX-LINKED YEN/DOLLAR DUAL-CURRENCY</p>
<p>		ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
